1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:01,770
(All characters, places,
and organizations are fictional.)

2
00:00:01,770 --> 00:00:03,270
(Children and teens were filmed
under production guidelines.)

3
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:05,680
(Episode 20)

4
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:06,980
(Da Mi's Wedding Fund)

5
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:19,760
(Regular Payment 200 Dollars,
Total 80,000 Dollars)

6
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:22,130
Could you get some money...

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,860
together for me?

8
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:28,170
If I want to have
an easier time at work right now,

9
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:29,870
I need to pay off
my urgent debts first.

10
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:34,570
You're the only one
who can help, Mom.

11
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:36,710
Mom.

12
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:39,240
Up until now,

13
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:41,250
I have been a son
you could be proud of.

14
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:43,850
Out of all your children,

15
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:46,420
I was the best at studying
and made the most money.

16
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,290
So...

17
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:50,590
can you just let me off the hook
for the next few years?

18
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,020
When Dae Chi asks for anything,

19
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,390
you don't even ask questions.
You just do everything for him.

20
00:00:55,830 --> 00:00:57,060
Look at you right now.

21
00:00:58,230 --> 00:00:59,330
Honestly, Mom,

22
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,900
you want to do whatever it takes...

23
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:05,100
to pay off all of Dae Chi's debt,
right?

24
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:10,210
I'm sorry, Da Mi.

25
00:01:12,610 --> 00:01:13,650
Mom is sorry.

26
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:19,350
To me, this isn't just money.

27
00:01:21,090 --> 00:01:22,190
It's time.

28
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,560
The time I spent raising
my Da Mi in my arms.

29
00:01:30,630 --> 00:01:32,460
The time I built up step by step.

30
00:02:20,910 --> 00:02:22,780
What are you doing right now?

31
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,320
You must be crazy.

32
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:26,780
Are you really
a world-class designer?

33
00:02:27,050 --> 00:02:29,990
Who rubs a silk tie with a wet wipe?

34
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:34,730
It looks old,
but it's a designer brand.

35
00:02:34,990 --> 00:02:36,360
I can't believe this.

36
00:02:37,130 --> 00:02:39,830
I know that,
but I panicked a little.

37
00:02:40,130 --> 00:02:41,300
Take it off, right now.

38
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,600
Excuse me?

39
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:45,500
I can just take it
to a luxury dry cleaner.

40
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:46,840
It is fine, so please finish eating.

41
00:02:46,970 --> 00:02:49,610
By the looks of it,
it seems like you really cherish it,

42
00:02:50,110 --> 00:02:52,610
so we need to do what we can
on it right away.

43
00:02:55,210 --> 00:02:56,810
What? Do you want me
to take it off for you?

44
00:02:57,920 --> 00:03:00,290
- What is that?
- You don't need to know.

45
00:03:00,890 --> 00:03:02,120
I said hurry up and take it off.

46
00:03:14,130 --> 00:03:16,370
This is precious to you, right?

47
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,840
Yes, someone precious to me...

48
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:21,610
I received it from someone I love.

49
00:03:23,810 --> 00:03:25,610
If I manage to remove this stain,

50
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:28,750
- you are paying for the meal.
- How exactly do you plan...

51
00:03:28,810 --> 00:03:30,110
on removing it right now?

52
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:32,750
That is really precious to me.

53
00:03:32,850 --> 00:03:34,290
It isn't too late,

54
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:35,750
so just give it back
before you ruin it further.

55
00:03:36,890 --> 00:03:39,090
You don't need to.
I was planning to pay anyway.

56
00:03:39,390 --> 00:03:41,290
Just sit quietly and wait.

57
00:03:41,590 --> 00:03:44,500
I'm not the type of person
to eat a free meal.

58
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:48,700
Miss, the restroom is
in the building out back.

59
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:50,170
You can use
the public restroom there.

60
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:52,140
Thank you, ma'am.

61
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,870
But...

62
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:30,040
You did it, Kang Da Mi.

63
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:33,410
Just what you would expect
from a VIP luxury boutique manager.

64
00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:34,780
Great job.

65
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:42,090
But this is way too worn out.

66
00:04:44,290 --> 00:04:45,890
Someone very precious...

67
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:48,260
He said he got it
from someone he loves, right?

68
00:04:50,090 --> 00:04:51,400
Well, he said he has a girlfriend,

69
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,030
so they must be
in a long-term relationship.

70
00:04:55,730 --> 00:04:59,270
Well, maybe his personality
is better than he looks?

71
00:05:11,850 --> 00:05:12,850
Hello?

72
00:05:13,250 --> 00:05:14,250
Where are you?

73
00:05:14,690 --> 00:05:16,950
I'm out running errands, why?

74
00:05:17,490 --> 00:05:18,620
Your tablet.

75
00:05:18,990 --> 00:05:21,730
I left it on the living room table,
so make sure you take it.

76
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:23,760
Where did you find it?

77
00:05:24,460 --> 00:05:25,700
The department store gave it to me.

78
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:29,430
How careless can you be
to drop something like this?

79
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:33,740
You went to the store again.
Did Manager Kang say she misses me?

80
00:05:33,970 --> 00:05:35,970
I'm so grateful.

81
00:05:36,170 --> 00:05:38,680
I should go and buy her a meal
sometime soon.

82
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,080
Hey.

83
00:05:40,380 --> 00:05:43,150
I won't stop you two
from acting like sisters,

84
00:05:43,410 --> 00:05:46,220
but don't embarrass your brother
any further.

85
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:48,220
I'm begging you, Cha Se Na.

86
00:06:07,610 --> 00:06:10,480
Where are you, sweetie?
Are you going to be late today?

87
00:06:10,910 --> 00:06:13,110
Yes, Mom, I still have work left
at the office.

88
00:06:13,610 --> 00:06:16,580
But Mom,
I really wanted to tell you this.

89
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,390
Do you know where I just went?

90
00:06:22,890 --> 00:06:24,960
I went to Madam Chairwoman
Hwang Geum Soon's mansion.

91
00:06:25,020 --> 00:06:27,190
- Mom, can you believe it?
- No way.

92
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:30,600
For what? Wait, that loan shark, no.

93
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:33,560
My daughter met the big shot
of the financial world,

94
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:35,500
Madam Chairwoman
Hwang Geum Soon, in person?

95
00:06:36,030 --> 00:06:38,770
Have things already
progressed that much?

96
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,610
No, it isn't like that.

97
00:06:40,910 --> 00:06:43,570
CEO Jeon got hurt a little,
so I escorted her home.

98
00:06:44,110 --> 00:06:47,750
I just went up to the front door.
This is a huge step forward, Mom.

99
00:06:48,450 --> 00:06:49,710
Really?

100
00:06:50,850 --> 00:06:52,850
Is the house nice?

101
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:55,950
It isn't a house.
It is a mansion, a golden mansion.

102
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:58,860
I'm definitely going to marry
into the company's family.

103
00:07:00,020 --> 00:07:01,360
I have completely made up
my mind today.

104
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:06,260
Ms. Kang Da Mi?

105
00:07:06,630 --> 00:07:07,630
Ms. Kang Da Mi.

106
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,370
Since the full refund
was a large amount,

107
00:07:10,470 --> 00:07:12,940
it must have significantly
impacted your sales,

108
00:07:13,270 --> 00:07:15,370
but you kindly handled it
until the end,

109
00:07:15,370 --> 00:07:16,770
and I'm grateful for that.

110
00:07:17,180 --> 00:07:20,810
And I came to see you
because I have a favor to ask.

111
00:07:20,950 --> 00:07:22,010
I came to see you.

112
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:28,250
When I saw you change
into sneakers that day...

113
00:07:28,690 --> 00:07:31,690
and run around to take care
of the customer's request...

114
00:07:31,690 --> 00:07:33,020
(K Department Store)

115
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:34,390
That was fast, right?

116
00:07:35,130 --> 00:07:36,790
I was not only moved,

117
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:38,330
but as a fashion company
team leader,

118
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:39,760
I also got an idea.

119
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:43,030
It's for our company to release
sneakers for busy women...

120
00:07:43,330 --> 00:07:46,400
that go well with skirts,
along with our other products.

121
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:51,210
Regarding this project,
I think I'll have...

122
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:54,550
to ask you for help
in many ways from now on.

123
00:07:55,050 --> 00:07:57,110
So would you like to have
a cup of tea with me?

124
00:07:57,780 --> 00:08:01,020
A meal would be even better.
Of course, to talk about work.

125
00:08:03,250 --> 00:08:04,390
This should be good enough, right?

126
00:08:05,490 --> 00:08:06,520
All right, let's go.

127
00:08:08,890 --> 00:08:10,730
But why am I so nervous?

128
00:08:11,330 --> 00:08:12,960
There's absolutely no reason
to be nervous, Cha Do Yun.

129
00:08:21,370 --> 00:08:24,240
(K Department Store)

130
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:26,640
Is Kang Da Mi here?

131
00:08:26,710 --> 00:08:29,410
Manager Kang took the day off today
due to personal reasons.

132
00:08:29,650 --> 00:08:31,620
If you have a request,
shall I pass it on to her?

133
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:34,020
No, I'll come back later.

134
00:08:36,690 --> 00:08:37,820
By any chance,

135
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:39,660
is she sick?

136
00:08:39,860 --> 00:08:43,060
No. You know how our manager is.

137
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:45,230
Even if she feels like collapsing
from exhaustion,

138
00:08:45,300 --> 00:08:47,060
she's the type
to always come to work.

139
00:08:47,430 --> 00:08:48,430
Is that so?

140
00:08:49,030 --> 00:08:50,030
Yes.

141
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:55,270
It's a relief that she's not sick.

142
00:08:57,780 --> 00:09:00,080
A lot of people
are looking for her today.

143
00:09:08,790 --> 00:09:10,860
What on earth did she take with her?

144
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:13,990
Wait...

145
00:09:14,260 --> 00:09:16,430
Only the yellow side
was complete last time.

146
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:18,630
What is this? It's still the same.

147
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:22,870
What are you trying to steal now?

148
00:09:23,300 --> 00:09:25,170
Is snooping through
other people's things your hobby?

149
00:09:25,570 --> 00:09:27,940
No, your bag was open,
so I just looked.

150
00:09:28,210 --> 00:09:29,410
Here, take it.

151
00:09:30,580 --> 00:09:31,580
What?

152
00:09:32,010 --> 00:09:33,410
What is this? It's really clean now.

153
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:36,550
How did you clean this
in just a few minutes?

154
00:09:36,950 --> 00:09:39,650
What did you use? Can I see it?
I'm really curious.

155
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:42,250
No, it's a trade secret.

156
00:09:42,850 --> 00:09:45,090
Anyway, since I cleaned
the stain perfectly,

157
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,720
let's call it even
for today's tuition.

158
00:09:47,460 --> 00:09:49,030
You pay the bill here.

159
00:09:50,130 --> 00:09:51,130
Okay.

160
00:09:52,700 --> 00:09:54,100
But what if they don't accept cards?

161
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:00,940
Excuse me, I'm sorry,
but I don't have any cash,

162
00:10:01,010 --> 00:10:03,770
- so could I do a bank transfer...
- Why are you even asking?

163
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,980
If you're paying, anything works.

164
00:10:10,180 --> 00:10:11,350
She says she accepts cards.

165
00:10:12,420 --> 00:10:14,720
Hurry up and pay. I'm busy.

166
00:10:15,090 --> 00:10:16,820
But you said they only
take cash earlier.

167
00:10:16,990 --> 00:10:19,620
I said mostly, not always.

168
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:30,370
Mother,
I'm really worried about this.

169
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:35,240
I mean, Dr. Ju is
an internal medicine specialist,

170
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,870
so how can he set my ankle?

171
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:40,710
I will just call Director Park here,
Mother.

172
00:10:40,850 --> 00:10:42,580
Even if he is
an internal medicine specialist,

173
00:10:42,850 --> 00:10:45,280
he is qualified enough
to take care of me.

174
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,120
He is a man of many talents.

175
00:10:47,750 --> 00:10:49,220
What are you doing, Mrs. Anseong?

176
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:51,790
- Hurry up and take care of her.
- Yes, madam.

177
00:10:56,130 --> 00:10:59,200
- Hold me gently.
- Yes, ma'am.

178
00:11:00,460 --> 00:11:02,730
It will hurt a little at first.

179
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:05,270
Closing your eyes
will make you more scared,

180
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:08,810
so look somewhere else
and think about work or something...

181
00:11:08,870 --> 00:11:10,440
- more relaxing.
- No.

182
00:11:10,510 --> 00:11:14,950
Yes, ma'am. Look at
the money tree pot over there.

183
00:11:14,950 --> 00:11:16,110
No. Ouch!

184
00:11:16,210 --> 00:11:19,780
Honey! Honey, what happened?

185
00:11:19,850 --> 00:11:21,320
- What happened here?
- Honey...

186
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:24,890
- Yes, I'm here.
- Do you not see your mother?

187
00:11:25,590 --> 00:11:26,590
I'm sorry, Mother.

188
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,790
I rushed over
after hearing she was hurt.

189
00:11:29,260 --> 00:11:30,590
Can you really do this?

190
00:11:31,430 --> 00:11:32,660
Yes, well...

191
00:11:33,330 --> 00:11:34,700
Her leg is very swollen.

192
00:11:34,770 --> 00:11:38,400
- Yes, honey.
- I will begin now.

193
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:39,540
Honey.

194
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:47,580
Honey!

195
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,690
Honey,

196
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:05,330
- it really hurts so much.
- Honey.

197
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:08,330
What should I do?
Does it hurt a lot?

198
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:10,030
I'm right here next to you.

199
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:15,240
Look at me.
It's me, Cha In Sung, your husband.

200
00:12:16,810 --> 00:12:18,180
All done.

201
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:23,010
Slowly, starting from your toes,

202
00:12:23,250 --> 00:12:24,880
to the top of your foot
and your ankle,

203
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,820
try moving them little by little
to the right and left.

204
00:12:28,590 --> 00:12:31,420
It might be uncomfortable at first,
but it will get better soon.

205
00:12:36,030 --> 00:12:37,930
Honey, are you okay?

206
00:12:39,030 --> 00:12:41,630
Are you really okay? How is it?

207
00:12:41,900 --> 00:12:43,470
How can I help you?

208
00:12:44,970 --> 00:12:48,110
I'm absolutely speechless.

209
00:12:49,410 --> 00:12:51,910
Excuse me? What did you say, Mother?

210
00:12:52,610 --> 00:12:55,110
What? Nothing.
You have been through a lot.

211
00:12:57,880 --> 00:13:01,790
Goodness. Are you okay? Oh no.

212
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:06,220
Will you be all right?

213
00:13:06,690 --> 00:13:08,390
Here, be careful.

214
00:13:08,460 --> 00:13:09,690
Yes, okay...

215
00:13:13,230 --> 00:13:15,170
How funny.

216
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:16,200
That was hilarious.

217
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:20,000
- Madam, why do you keep laughing?
- What?

218
00:13:20,570 --> 00:13:23,770
When did I laugh?

219
00:13:23,770 --> 00:13:25,110
Well, until just a moment ago...

220
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,510
Then I will go
prepare the heating pad...

221
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:35,450
I just can't stop laughing.

222
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,590
It's so funny.

223
00:13:43,990 --> 00:13:46,430
I think I should be going now.

224
00:13:46,930 --> 00:13:48,970
Shall I escort you to your room?

225
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:50,530
That's fine.

226
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:54,210
Are you sure she does not need
to see an orthopedist?

227
00:13:54,940 --> 00:13:57,580
CEO Jeon, how is the pain?

228
00:13:59,140 --> 00:14:00,410
I think it is getting
a little better.

229
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:04,280
Thank you for your hard work.
You may go.

230
00:14:05,180 --> 00:14:06,220
All right, then.

231
00:14:13,260 --> 00:14:16,330
Wait, do you think
Dr. Ju purposely...

232
00:14:16,390 --> 00:14:18,500
set your bone in a way
that would hurt more?

233
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:21,030
I really think he did.

234
00:14:21,370 --> 00:14:22,400
No way.

235
00:14:23,870 --> 00:14:24,940
But...

236
00:14:25,900 --> 00:14:26,900
But what?

237
00:14:28,070 --> 00:14:30,710
I think we really need
to look into him now.

238
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:32,680
Look into what?

239
00:14:34,350 --> 00:14:37,880
How he met Mother
and got connected to her,

240
00:14:38,650 --> 00:14:41,490
and just how much she trusts him.

241
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,290
What do you think?

242
00:14:44,590 --> 00:14:46,020
I think so, too.

243
00:14:46,590 --> 00:14:48,230
We should have
looked into him earlier.

244
00:14:48,490 --> 00:14:50,460
He comes around way too often.

245
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:19,460
Who dropped this?

246
00:15:20,790 --> 00:15:22,190
(ID Card, Kang Da Mi)

247
00:15:22,530 --> 00:15:23,530
Wait.

248
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:28,870
Please drive safely.
And a little fast, if possible.

249
00:15:29,500 --> 00:15:33,140
Isn't she the one I dropped off
at the flea market earlier?

250
00:15:34,610 --> 00:15:38,440
She didn't use the app
to call the taxi,

251
00:15:38,510 --> 00:15:40,010
so I don't have her number.

252
00:15:40,810 --> 00:15:42,680
Does she have
a business card in here?

253
00:15:45,780 --> 00:15:47,180
If not, I can call
the credit card company...

254
00:15:49,650 --> 00:15:50,650
What?

255
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:53,260
(ID Card, Kang Da Mi)

256
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,360
Wait.

257
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:57,490
Her address is...

258
00:16:04,270 --> 00:16:05,270
Excuse me.

259
00:16:05,540 --> 00:16:06,540
What is it?

260
00:16:07,870 --> 00:16:09,840
You don't have to thank me.

261
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:14,310
It was only natural
for you to pay for the meal.

262
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:18,220
I even got the stain off your tie
with my secret weapon.

263
00:16:19,720 --> 00:16:22,090
I was just about to say goodbye
because I was leaving first.

264
00:16:22,420 --> 00:16:23,520
Is that so?

265
00:16:24,090 --> 00:16:26,220
Then go ahead.

266
00:16:28,160 --> 00:16:30,290
Miss, you need to take this.

267
00:16:32,860 --> 00:16:34,160
That?

268
00:16:36,030 --> 00:16:38,040
I knew you would do this.

269
00:16:38,300 --> 00:16:40,570
You really are
like Hansel and Gretel.

270
00:16:40,700 --> 00:16:42,710
Why do you always
leave things behind...

271
00:16:42,770 --> 00:16:44,070
or drop them everywhere, Kang Da Mi?

272
00:16:44,070 --> 00:16:45,080
You should be more...

273
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:47,280
Thank you.
Take good care of it. Here.

274
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:50,680
(Fun Playtime
with Dudu the Rhythm Bear)

275
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:52,920
What am I supposed to do with this?

276
00:16:53,550 --> 00:16:54,950
What are you doing?
My arm is falling off.

277
00:16:56,490 --> 00:16:57,490
Okay.

278
00:16:57,550 --> 00:16:59,820
(Fun Playtime
with Dudu the Rhythm Bear)

279
00:17:13,140 --> 00:17:15,940
What is all this?
Did you prepare all of this?

280
00:17:16,810 --> 00:17:17,810
Sit down.

281
00:17:22,250 --> 00:17:24,780
Why let these great skills
go to waste?

282
00:17:26,650 --> 00:17:27,820
This is delicious.

283
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:32,620
You must have something to say.

284
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:34,560
Don't beat around the bush
and just say it.

285
00:17:36,190 --> 00:17:39,360
Are you planning
to keep working at that clinic?

286
00:17:40,630 --> 00:17:41,630
Yes.

287
00:17:42,270 --> 00:17:43,300
Yes?

288
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:46,070
You know exactly
what is across the street,

289
00:17:46,140 --> 00:17:47,840
and you can still just say yes?

290
00:17:48,210 --> 00:17:51,580
What if you happen to run
into my family members?

291
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:54,910
So what if I get caught?

292
00:17:54,980 --> 00:17:56,780
I have nothing
to be ashamed of anymore.

293
00:17:56,950 --> 00:17:58,880
I'm in a desperate situation,
and for my child's future,

294
00:17:58,950 --> 00:18:00,880
I'm working hard
to earn some money.

295
00:18:00,950 --> 00:18:02,090
Is there a problem with that?

296
00:18:04,320 --> 00:18:06,120
Honey, Ji Young.

297
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:09,630
I've been your legal wife
all these years,

298
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:12,000
and I've raised Ye Ri
with everything she could want.

299
00:18:12,460 --> 00:18:14,330
Isn't it only right that
your mother finally accepts me...

300
00:18:14,330 --> 00:18:15,730
as her daughter-in-law now?

301
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,500
I have nothing to hide.
What is wrong with you?

302
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:20,540
What?
You really have nothing to hide?

303
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:22,370
You have absolutely nothing
to be ashamed of?

304
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:23,810
Of course.

305
00:18:24,370 --> 00:18:26,380
If you're so worried
and self-conscious,

306
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,910
you should go to her first.

307
00:18:28,110 --> 00:18:29,410
Tell her that you moved
your wife and child...

308
00:18:29,410 --> 00:18:31,780
into a semi-basement rental
because it was hard to make a living.

309
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:33,580
Get on your knees
and beg your mother.

310
00:18:33,980 --> 00:18:35,090
Who knows?

311
00:18:35,150 --> 00:18:36,950
That stubborn old woman
might soften up...

312
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:39,260
facing her death and give us
a small piece of her fortune.

313
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:43,260
- What?
- Even if she disowned you...

314
00:18:43,330 --> 00:18:46,130
and kicked you out,
you are still mother and son.

315
00:18:46,460 --> 00:18:48,900
Blood ties are incredibly strong.

316
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:51,470
No matter what you say,

317
00:18:51,540 --> 00:18:53,100
I will keep working
at Ju Kyung Ho Internal Medicine.

318
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:57,240
Please don't do this.
Think about it again.

319
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,580
You said the pay was low
anyway, right?

320
00:19:00,140 --> 00:19:03,450
If something happens,
or if you get caught,

321
00:19:03,810 --> 00:19:06,120
we will be fine.
But what about Ye Ri?

322
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:07,990
She doesn't know anything.

323
00:19:08,590 --> 00:19:10,690
Are you not thinking
about that at all?

324
00:19:13,290 --> 00:19:14,290
Ye Ri?

325
00:19:16,090 --> 00:19:17,090
Yes.

326
00:19:25,370 --> 00:19:26,940
But where do you work,
and what do you do?

327
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:30,970
As your ex-husband,
I have the right to know.

328
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:34,180
You have no parents or siblings,
and you don't even weigh 50kg.

329
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:36,010
How are you supposed
to endure working three shifts?

330
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:37,780
Where is this place, anyway?

331
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:39,620
Dad, aren't you going to do
the dishes?

332
00:19:41,620 --> 00:19:43,590
Dad is a bit busy right now.

333
00:19:44,490 --> 00:19:45,490
Hey, Kang Dae Chi.

334
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:47,460
Since you are home early,
you do them.

335
00:19:49,030 --> 00:19:52,500
I was just about to do them anyway.
I'm getting up.

336
00:19:56,130 --> 00:19:57,530
(Incoming Call)

337
00:19:57,670 --> 00:19:58,940
What is this? Who is it?

338
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:01,810
Hey, you will find out
if you answer it, punk.

339
00:20:03,110 --> 00:20:05,380
Do I look like I have time
to answer spam calls?

340
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:14,450
Dae Chi.

341
00:20:14,990 --> 00:20:17,250
Someone is here to see you.
Go out to say hello.

342
00:20:17,820 --> 00:20:19,560
Who would come looking for me
at this hour?

343
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:23,390
How should I know?
She is a very young and pretty lady.

344
00:20:23,830 --> 00:20:25,330
She asked me to get you.

345
00:20:25,430 --> 00:20:27,030
She says she has
important business with you.

346
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,870
She looks very wealthy, who is she?

347
00:20:31,940 --> 00:20:33,040
I have no idea.

348
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:35,810
If you don't know, you'll find out
when you go out, Uncle Dae Chi.

349
00:20:36,670 --> 00:20:37,670
Yes.

350
00:20:38,180 --> 00:20:39,240
Unbelievable.

351
00:20:46,550 --> 00:20:48,090
A young and pretty lady?

352
00:20:49,620 --> 00:20:51,960
It's been over a year
since I had a fling, so who could it be?

353
00:20:53,360 --> 00:20:55,790
A girl who looks very wealthy...

354
00:20:57,290 --> 00:20:58,300
Who was it again?

355
00:21:13,980 --> 00:21:15,110
Wait, are you Yeon Jee?

356
00:21:16,710 --> 00:21:17,710
No?

357
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:19,780
Is that you, Su Yeong?

358
00:21:26,190 --> 00:21:28,660
I guess people really do act
how they look.

359
00:21:28,830 --> 00:21:30,160
You must have dated around
quite a bit.

360
00:21:31,660 --> 00:21:34,970
What a shame.
I'm neither Yeon Jee nor Su Yeong.

361
00:21:36,870 --> 00:21:39,040
What? Who are you?

362
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:42,340
I'm Cha Se Na.
Please pay back your loan.

363
00:21:42,870 --> 00:21:44,340
I'm from Hwanggeum Capital.

364
00:21:44,980 --> 00:21:46,180
Hwang... Excuse me?

365
00:21:47,740 --> 00:21:49,810
Why are you so surprised?

366
00:21:50,710 --> 00:21:52,050
I couldn't reach you
by phone at all,

367
00:21:52,120 --> 00:21:53,950
so I just came to collect the debt.

368
00:21:55,120 --> 00:21:56,320
Fortunately, you're still alive.

369
00:21:56,950 --> 00:22:00,990
Are you really from
Hwanggeum Capital?

370
00:22:01,990 --> 00:22:03,430
You look too young,

371
00:22:03,990 --> 00:22:05,930
and you don't look like
someone from that industry.

372
00:22:10,070 --> 00:22:12,470
Here are the details
of your debt, Mr. Kang Dae Chi.

373
00:22:13,040 --> 00:22:14,570
The principal amount you borrowed...

374
00:22:14,910 --> 00:22:17,340
from Hwanggeum Capital is
a total of 280,000 dollars,

375
00:22:17,740 --> 00:22:18,740
correct?

376
00:22:20,210 --> 00:22:23,280
Look, I'm really sorry,

377
00:22:24,110 --> 00:22:26,850
but I'm not in a position
to repay the loan right now.

378
00:22:27,280 --> 00:22:28,420
If you just wait a few months,

379
00:22:28,490 --> 00:22:31,590
- I will really pay it back...
- Our company has already waited...

380
00:22:31,990 --> 00:22:33,890
long enough for you, sir.

381
00:22:34,390 --> 00:22:36,530
You haven't even paid the interest
for over a year.

382
00:22:36,830 --> 00:22:39,300
Please show some
sincerity by paying...

383
00:22:39,930 --> 00:22:41,260
at least three months
of overdue interest.

384
00:22:41,500 --> 00:22:43,400
Then I will report back
to the company...

385
00:22:43,470 --> 00:22:45,240
and try to delay the legal action.

386
00:22:46,070 --> 00:22:47,970
Since you are a manager
in purchasing at a large company,

387
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:49,710
you have plenty of ability to repay,

388
00:22:50,740 --> 00:22:52,180
and your intention to do so
seemed clear.

389
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:53,710
I will tell my superiors that.

390
00:22:56,410 --> 00:22:58,280
I absolutely can't tell her...

391
00:22:58,350 --> 00:22:59,820
that I have been suspended
from work.

392
00:23:00,420 --> 00:23:02,920
So, about the three months
of overdue interest,

393
00:23:02,990 --> 00:23:05,360
can you deposit it
into the virtual account by tomorrow?

394
00:23:06,390 --> 00:23:09,560
Can you tell me
how much the interest is?

395
00:23:09,830 --> 00:23:12,330
Since your loan has been
overdue for over a year,

396
00:23:13,100 --> 00:23:16,600
applying the current
maximum legal interest rate...

397
00:23:16,600 --> 00:23:20,440
of 20 percent per year
to your loan of 280,000 dollars,

398
00:23:20,900 --> 00:23:23,310
the interest comes
to 56,000 dollars.

399
00:23:23,910 --> 00:23:27,840
If we divide that by 12 months,
it's about 4,660 dollars.

400
00:23:27,940 --> 00:23:29,050
Then,

401
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:31,110
three months of interest would be...

402
00:23:32,650 --> 00:23:35,550
Are you telling me to deposit
14,000 dollars by tomorrow?

403
00:23:36,490 --> 00:23:37,590
Yes, that is correct.

404
00:23:39,690 --> 00:23:40,690
By the way,

405
00:23:41,760 --> 00:23:43,160
what is your position?

406
00:23:44,130 --> 00:23:46,060
Me? I'm just an employee.

407
00:23:47,700 --> 00:23:49,030
Just an employee?

408
00:23:50,600 --> 00:23:51,600
An assistant manager.

409
00:23:54,540 --> 00:23:56,040
(Delinquent Account Management
and Collection Review Report)

410
00:23:58,540 --> 00:24:01,610
Everything looks like
a designer brand from head to toe.

411
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:03,850
On an assistant manager's salary...

412
00:24:04,820 --> 00:24:05,980
Are they all knockoffs?

413
00:24:06,620 --> 00:24:07,980
Mr. Kang Dae Chi.

414
00:24:08,490 --> 00:24:10,950
I was asking if you could
make the deposit by tomorrow.

415
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:14,020
I understand,
so please just go for now.

416
00:24:14,260 --> 00:24:16,160
And in the future,
please don't come...

417
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:17,760
to my house like this.

418
00:24:18,600 --> 00:24:20,660
My family already knows
about my debt,

419
00:24:20,660 --> 00:24:21,900
and they are all worried.

420
00:24:21,900 --> 00:24:25,540
Especially since we have
my elderly grandmother living with us.

421
00:24:25,670 --> 00:24:27,770
Do you live
with your grandmother too?

422
00:24:28,070 --> 00:24:29,110
Excuse me?

423
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:35,180
If you pay off the overdue interest
and the principal all at once,

424
00:24:35,650 --> 00:24:38,350
I will never have a reason
to visit you again.

425
00:24:39,380 --> 00:24:41,890
Actually, I was going to visit
your office today,

426
00:24:41,890 --> 00:24:43,320
but I came here instead.

427
00:24:44,050 --> 00:24:47,320
What? You absolutely
can't go to my office.

428
00:24:47,690 --> 00:24:49,030
I will make sure...

429
00:24:49,090 --> 00:24:50,390
to answer all your collection calls
from now on,

430
00:24:50,690 --> 00:24:53,030
so please never,
ever visit my office.

431
00:24:53,030 --> 00:24:54,030
Do you understand?

432
00:24:54,760 --> 00:24:56,430
Yes. I suppose I can do that.

433
00:24:57,500 --> 00:24:58,640
You promised.

434
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:01,670
- Goodness.
- My back...

435
00:25:01,940 --> 00:25:03,410
Oh, my back.

436
00:25:04,110 --> 00:25:06,110
There is never a quiet day.

437
00:25:06,740 --> 00:25:09,980
Mi Mi, I guess I'm getting old too.

438
00:25:10,950 --> 00:25:12,050
Could you just...

439
00:25:14,220 --> 00:25:15,490
Leave her alone.

440
00:25:16,420 --> 00:25:18,920
Ri Ja just blurts out
whatever comes to her mind,

441
00:25:18,990 --> 00:25:20,560
so she probably has
no hidden agenda.

442
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,590
How could she have no hidden agenda?

443
00:25:22,660 --> 00:25:24,690
She is always too busy
stuffing her face.

444
00:25:24,930 --> 00:25:27,800
- With rice and rice cakes.
- Mi Mi.

445
00:25:27,860 --> 00:25:29,470
This is driving me crazy.

446
00:25:29,830 --> 00:25:32,240
Please. I'm begging you
just this once.

447
00:25:32,340 --> 00:25:33,870
Is that not Dae Chi's voice?

448
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:35,810
Dae Chi?

449
00:25:36,510 --> 00:25:38,010
Oh, right.

450
00:25:38,280 --> 00:25:40,840
Some young lady
came looking for him earlier.

451
00:25:40,840 --> 00:25:41,980
I went and got him for her.

452
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:43,810
- A young lady?
- A young lady?

453
00:25:43,810 --> 00:25:44,850
Yes.

454
00:25:48,120 --> 00:25:50,320
Stay here, Mother. I will go check.

455
00:25:53,860 --> 00:25:56,030
All right.
If you keep your promise first,

456
00:25:56,030 --> 00:25:57,230
I will keep mine, too.

457
00:25:57,560 --> 00:26:00,300
I said I understand.
Please just leave now.

458
00:26:01,100 --> 00:26:02,830
I'm terrified someone might see us.

459
00:26:03,730 --> 00:26:05,140
Dae Chi, who is it?

460
00:26:08,370 --> 00:26:09,540
Mom.

461
00:26:13,110 --> 00:26:15,350
You, you little punk.

462
00:26:16,210 --> 00:26:19,680
Mom, what are you
imagining right now?

463
00:26:20,380 --> 00:26:21,820
It's absolutely not what you think.

464
00:26:22,190 --> 00:26:24,690
What exactly do you think
I'm imagining?

465
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:26,160
Go on, tell me.

466
00:26:27,060 --> 00:26:28,090
I said, what is this about?

467
00:26:30,530 --> 00:26:33,000
But, Mom...

468
00:26:49,910 --> 00:26:51,850
(Mission: Mompossible)

469
00:27:17,010 --> 00:27:19,910
What kind of medicine
should I take to get better?

470
00:27:20,010 --> 00:27:22,650
Could you start
with a physical examination?

471
00:27:22,780 --> 00:27:24,480
What is this? What do I do?

472
00:27:24,610 --> 00:27:28,820
How could they put you, a VVIP CEO,
through such an embarrassment?

473
00:27:29,150 --> 00:27:31,620
Should I go to the store myself
and file a complaint?

474
00:27:31,890 --> 00:27:33,190
Take care of it,
Assistant Manager Kang.

475
00:27:33,790 --> 00:27:37,360
I want to ask more questions.
I have so many things I want to ask.

476
00:27:38,460 --> 00:27:40,430
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)

